{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mei.report",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她跑进事务所喊\"听我说\"",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mei.report",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mei.report",
    "idolId": "mei",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "制作人！听我说听我说～！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "愛依？这么高兴，发生什么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "有的有的！之前那个课题，总算过了的感觉！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "太好了！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "多亏了制作人嘛！真的谢谢啦！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她抓着我袖子晃，完全不掩饰。）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "うち，第一次觉得学习好像也没那么糟。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那是因为你没有放弃。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……是那样吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "嘿嘿……那，うち是不是也能把别的事做好。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然能。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "好！那，下次的课うち也要好好做！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她跑出去之前，回头补了一句。）",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……制作人，谢啦。"
      }
    }
  },
